@seq 1
@entry RESEARCH_LOCAL
🔎 RESEARCH_LOCAL
Obj(LocalResearch{query,scope}) → Mor(local.evidence) → Evidence
⊢ local_or_private_target(scope)
⊢ web=SKIPPED_UNLESS_EXPLICIT
🔎 EPUB
Mor(kavita-fetch-search.search[keywords]) → Sources
EMPTY ⇒ Evidence(epub=N_A(no_hit))
ERROR ⇒ Evidence(epub=FAILED(non_secret_cause))
🔎 MEMORY
Obj(Task{keywords}) → Mor(llm-mem.search[level=2,json]) → Precedents
ERROR ∨ missing_executable ⇒ Evidence(memory=FAILED(non_secret_cause))
⊢ report={Facts,Inferences,Unknowns,Sources,Precedents,Constraints}
RESEARCH_LOCAL ⇒ 🧠 PLAN
